<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian Jan unemployment unchanged 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian Jan unemployment unchanged 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's unemployment rate remained unchanged in January at 6.2 percent compared to the previous month, the country's labour exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The labour exchange said in a statement that the number of registered unemployed rose slightly during January from 109,385 to 109,851.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT  Jan 1997	  Dec 1996     Jan 1996</p>
<p> Rate (percent)	     6.2		 6.2	    7.9</p>
<p> Number of unemployed     109,851	   109,385	137,350</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom + 371 721 5240</p>
